    [Doc][Misc] Remove redundant codes and configs for sparse kv offload (#18302)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    This PR updates config for sparse kv offload from the following aspects:
    
    1. Drop unused "none" mode for fused_op_type along with fused_op_type
    argument. Now fused_copy_sfa is the default option. We still maintain
    the use_fused_overlap for legacy, and can switch to it by setting it to
    true.
    2. Default topk_buffer_size to 2048 * (1+num_speculative_tokens).
    3. Default backend of SfaRemoteD2HConnector to be memfabric.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    Yes. See description above.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
    Signed-off-by: Angazenn <supperccell@163.com>

